        <dct:description xml:lang="en">Confidential dataset for scientific purposes of the Spain Health Survey (ENSE). It contains demographic, identification, socioeconomic, and employment information on household members, as well as data on the residential environment, housing problems, and household income, among other variables.</dct:description>
