        <dct:description xml:lang="en">Confidential dataset for scientific purposes of the Time Use Survey (EET). It contains individualized records in fifteen-minute intervals regarding the performance or non-performance of work activity throughout the twenty-four hours of the day, among other variables.</dct:description>
