        <dct:description xml:lang="en">Confidential dataset for scientific purposes from the MNP: Marriages Statistics. It contains detailed information on the socio-demographic characteristics of the spouses (age, occupation, education, marital status) and geographical variables of residence and place of celebration.</dct:description>
