        <dct:description xml:lang="en">Confidential dataset for scientific purposes from the Water Supply and Sanitation Statistics. The survey seeks to provide regular, reliable, and comparable data in order to describe the state, the pressures exerted, and society's responses aimed at optimizing the use of water resources.</dct:description>
