        <dct:description xml:lang="en">Confidential dataset for scientific purposes from Debt Securities Issuers (BEV). It contains information on nearly 40,000 issues launched by Spanish issuers both inside and outside Spain, providing detailed data on issuers and debt securities issues.</dct:description>
